+2.  **ReLU and Exponential Activations:** Asymmetric unsigned quantization with range $[0, 2^B - 1]$ [S1]. Parameters $v_{max}$ and $r_v$ are trainable [S1]. Bitwidth $b$ is trainable [S1].
